  {
    "id": 6010001070010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あっ、プロデューサーさん、お疲れ様です！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000107/6010001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001070020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あの！　私、今後のために色々と考えたんです！\r\nまずですね、チョコアイドルとしては──",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000107/6010001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ち、智代子……？\r\nその……大丈夫、なのか？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001070030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　ずっと落ち込んだままではいられません！\r\nまた頑張らなきゃですから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000107/6010001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか\r\nさすが、智代子だな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001070040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……えへへ、プロデューサーさんは、やっぱり優しいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000107/6010001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001070050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あの、私、もっと成長できるように、\r\nまだまだ挑戦してみてもいいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000107/6010001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子なら、そう言ってくれると思ってた\r\nくじけているヒマなんてないよな",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001070060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　チョコアイドル園田智代子は、永久に不滅なので！\r\n……って、こういう台詞は勝ったときに言うべきですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000107/6010001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001070070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "とにかく、アイドル活動はすっごくすっごく楽しいので、\r\nこんなところで止まるなんてありえないです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000107/6010001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001070080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もっと輝いた姿を、ファンのみんなにも\r\nプロデューサーさんにも、絶対見てもらいますから！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
